OL,3,GNEWSAFines may be brought in for
OL,4,Aanti-social behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in a town branded a shoplifting
OL,7,Fhotspot could be given extra powers to
OL,8,Fclamp down on crime.
OL,10,FWiltshire Council wants feedback from
OL,11,Fresidents on whether to implement a
OL,12,FPublic Spaces Protection Order (PSPO)
OL,13,Fin parts of Trowbridge, which could see
OL,14,Fpeople fined #100 on the spot for
OL,15,Fengaging in anti-social behaviour.
OL,17,FLocal officers say street drinking,
OL,18,Fdrug misuse, shoplifting, aggression,
OL,19,Fpublic order offences and criminal
OL,20,Fdamage are among the key issues they
OL,21,Fface.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
