OL,3,GNEWSAFines may be brought in for
OL,4,Aanti-social behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeighbourhood Sergeant Gemma Rutter
OL,7,Fsaid the PSPO could give officers
OL,8,Fadditional powers to proactively target
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour which has a
OL,10,F"detrimental effect on the wider
OL,11,Fcommunity."
